                "text": "Our priority during ongoing extreme weather crises should be people's safety. Not spreading lies.\n\nFamilies have lost loved ones. They're returning to homes to find they have nowhere to sleep. Firefighters are putting their lives on the line to prevent more suffering.\n\nDo better.",
